# AdaptiveDSA AI Learning Coach Configuration
#
# The Learning Coach works completely out-of-the-box with high-quality,
# deterministic DSA mentoring rules without any API keys or paid dependencies.
#
# If you wish to connect an external LLM for real-time natural language coaching,
# set ONE of the following environment variables. The server will automatically
# detect it and upgrade from Deterministic Mentor Mode to Live AI Mode.
#
# NOTE: Never commit actual API keys to source control.
# Keys are strictly kept on the server and are NEVER exposed to the frontend bundle.

# Option 1: Google Gemini API (Recommended: fast, JSON structured output)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Option 2: OpenAI API
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
